One day, a young girl named Alice, who was always fascinated by the untold stories behind the old house, decided to take matters into her own hands, driven by an insatiable curiosity. She made her way to the front door, which was ajar, inviting yet ominous, and cautiously made her way inside, her heart pounding with both excitement and trepidation.

